 "text": "Stanton County Sheriff's Department | Stanton County KS\nSkip to main content\nToggle Navigation\nClose Navigation\nHome\nContact Us\nGovernment --> Board of Commissioners Agendas & Minutes\nElections Election Results\nStanton County Board Appointments\nDepartments Airport\nAppaiser\nAttorney\nCounty Clerk\nDistrict Court\nHealth Department\nHuman Resources\nLandfill\nNoxious Weed\nRegister of Deeds\nRoad & Bridge\nTreasurer\nPublic Safety EMS\nFire & Rescue\nSheriff's Department\nEmergency Management\nEmergency & Severe Weather Alerts\nBusiness --> Human Resources\nJobs\nCommunity --> About Us History\nCemeteries\nMuseum\nPrairie Pines Golf Course\nBattin Park\nMemorial Living Center\nSenior Center\nGrants & Scholarships KCCEOA Scholarship Program\nKansas Commerce Grants\nServices --> Online Payments\nOpen Records Requests\nEvents Commissioners Meetings\nCommunity Events\nSearch\nDepartments & Committees\nType\nEvent Date\nBreadcrumb\nHome\nToggle Menu\nStanton County Sheriff's Department\nIn an Emergency: Call 911\nWhen calling 911, clearly tell the operator what kind of help you need—ambulance, fire, or law enforcement. Stay calm. It is easier for dispatchers to assist you when they can clearly understand what you're saying.\nStay on the line—do not hang up.\nBe ready to provide:\nYour name and current location\nThe location of the incident (if different from where you are)\nDescriptions of any suspects, weapons, or vehicles involved\nLicense plate numbers, if known\nDispatchers will confirm your phone number and address. This is especially important if you live in a mobile home park or on a private road, as your 911 address may differ from what’s listed with your phone provider. If you are unsure of your correct address, please contact the Stanton County Sheriff's Office to verify.\nView PDF of Page\nStanton County Sheriff's Department\nFrequently Asked Questions\nContact Information\nPhone Number\nNon-Emergency: (620) 492-6866\nFax Number\n(620) 492-2585\nAddress\n208 N Chestnut St\nPO Box 520\nJohnson , KS 67855\nStaff Contacts\nClayton Kester\nSheriff\n(620) 492-6866\nEmail\nView All Listings\nSelect Language ​ ▼\nStaff Login\n201 North Main Street | Johnson City, KS 67855 | (620) 492‑2140\nGovernment Websites by CivicPlus®\nOriginal text\nRate this translation\nYour feedback will be used to help improve Google Translate",
